# Jetson aarch64 wheels mirror (see README.md). The torch wheel is ~170 MB -- too big for
# git; fetch it with deploy/tools/fetch_jetson_etam_wheels.sh (checksum-pinned in SHA256SUMS).
# The torchvision wheel is not shipped either: build it once on a JP5 Jetson (README.md)
# and drop it here; the exception below lets you commit it to your own fork if you want
# later robots to skip the build.
*.whl
!torchvision-*.whl
